[chat] Tool call: write_file args={"content":"# folder-size-cli\n\nCLI to calculate the total size of a folder recursively and print the result in bytes.\n\n## Project\n\n- Package: `folder-size-cli`\n- Version: `1.0.0`\n- Entry point: `src/index.ts`\n- Build output: `dist/index.js`\n- Binary name: `folder-size`\n\n## Install\n\n```bash\nnpm install\n```\n\n## Build\n\n```bash\nnpm run build\n```\n\n## Run\n\nRun with TypeScript:\n\n```bash\nnpm start -- <folderPath>\n```\n\nExample:\n\n```bash\nnpm start -- .\n```\n\nAfter building, run the compiled CLI:\n\n```bash\nnode dist/index.js <folderPath>\n```\n\nExample output:\n\n```text\nFOLDER_SIZE_BYTES=28854443\n```\n\n## Reports\n\nReports were generated in the `reports/` directory.\n\n| Step | Command | Result | Report files |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Install | `npm install` | Passed, 0 vulnerabilities | `reports/install-report.md`, `reports/install-output.log` |\n| Build | `npm run build` | Passed | `reports/build-report.md`, `reports/build-output.log` |\n| Run | `npm start -- .` | Passed, returned `FOLDER_SIZE_BYTES=28854443` | `reports/run-report.md`, `reports/run-output.log` |\n\n## Latest command output summary\n\n### Install\n\n```text\nup to date, audited 39 packages\nfound 0 vulnerabilities\n```\n\n### Build\n\n```text\n> folder-size-cli@1.0.0 build\n> tsc\n```\n\n### Run\n\n```text\n> folder-size-cli@1.0.0 start\n> ts-node src/index.ts .\n\nFOLDER_SIZE_BYTES=28854443\n```\n\n## Notes\n\n- The CLI walks files and subdirectories recursively using Node.js `fs` and `path`.\n- Files or folders that cannot be accessed are skipped silently.\n- A TypeScript compile issue in the yargs parse cast was corrected so the project builds successfully under `strict` mode.\n","options":{"append":false},"path":"C:\\Users\\zx\\Desktop\\polymech\\polymech-mono\\packages\\media\\cpp\\tests\\run-tool\\cli-app\\README.md"}
